{"title":"How Far I'll Go","artist":"Auli'i Cravalho (Moana OST)","date":"2026-07-28","sourceId":"14411850:023","sourceHash":"1069d9a5d9e3f40fbbf49ea1442d4827c22bc20e6e03eab45bfd3c560d8e3b67","duration":166.59999999999854,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":17.710467,"end":21.595,"text":"I've been staring at the edge of the water","translation":"물가 끝을 바라본 지 오래야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":21.770772,"end":25.073541,"text":"'Long as I can remember","translation":"기억나는 한","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":25.121024,"end":27.485,"text":"Never really knowing why","translation":"왜인진 모르겠어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":29.46135,"end":33.395,"text":"I wish I could be the perfect daughter","translation":"완벽한 딸이 되고 싶은데","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":33.911684,"end":36.275,"text":"But I come back to the water","translation":"난 또 물가로 돌아와","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":36.741897,"end":39.495,"text":"No matter how hard I try","translation":"아무리 애써도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":41.092224,"end":42.431184,"text":"Every turn I take","translation":"내가 도는 모든 길","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":42.582336,"end":43.925,"text":"Every trail I track","translation":"내가 따라간 모든 흔적","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":44.10245,"end":45.435,"text":"Every path I make","translation":"내가 만든 모든 길","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":45.652567,"end":46.825,"text":"Every road leads back","translation":"모든 길은 날 되돌려","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":47.082674,"end":49.939123,"text":"To the place I know where I cannot go","translation":"내가 아는 곳 갈 수 없는 곳으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":49.96289,"end":52.425,"text":"Where I long to be","translation":"내가 머물고 싶은 곳","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":52.7531,"end":54.885,"text":"See the line where the sky meets the sea?","translation":"하늘과 바다가 맞닿은 저 선 보여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":55.273289,"end":57.545,"text":"It calls me","translation":"날 부르고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":57.733474,"end":60.475,"text":"And no one knows","translation":"아무도 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":60.633692,"end":63.555,"text":"How far it goes","translation":"얼마나 멀리 이어질지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":64.243964,"end":68.895,"text":"If the wind in my sail on the sea stays behind me","translation":"바다 위 내 돛의 바람이 나를 뒤에서 밀어준다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":69.154333,"end":72.135,"text":"One day I'll know","translation":"언젠간 알게 돼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":72.664596,"end":76.155,"text":"If I go, there's just no telling how far I'll go","translation":"내가 간다면 얼마나 멀리 갈지는 아무도 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":76.324871,"end":79.605,"text":"I know everybody on this island","translation":"이 섬의 모든 사람을 알아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":79.915141,"end":82.645,"text":"Seems so happy on this island","translation":"이 섬 사람들은 모두 행복해 보여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":83.015374,"end":87.255,"text":"Everything is by design","translation":"모든 게 정해진 대로야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":87.385703,"end":91.175,"text":"I know everybody on this island","translation":"이 섬의 모든 사람을 알아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":91.436007,"end":94.035,"text":"Has a role on this island","translation":"이 섬에서 각자 역할이 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":94.366227,"end":97.245,"text":"So maybe I can roll with mine","translation":"그러니 나도 내 몫에 맞출 수 있겠지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":98.276521,"end":99.79401,"text":"I can lead with pride","translation":"난 자랑스럽게 이끌 수 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":99.896643,"end":101.235603,"text":"I can make us strong","translation":"우릴 강하게 할 수 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":101.426758,"end":103.915,"text":"I'll be satisfied if I play along","translation":"난 내 몫을 해내면 만족할 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":104.216967,"end":106.894888,"text":"But the voice inside sings a different song","translation":"하지만 마음속 목소린 다른 노랠 불러","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":107.137187,"end":112.582293,"text":"What is wrong with me?","translation":"내게 뭐가 잘못된 걸까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":112.627599,"end":114.885,"text":"See the light as it shines on the sea?","translation":"바다 위로 빛나는 저 빛 보여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":115.197792,"end":117.535,"text":"It's blinding","translation":"눈이 부셔","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":117.777986,"end":120.325,"text":"But no one knows","translation":"아무도 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":120.828216,"end":123.565,"text":"How deep it goes","translation":"얼마나 깊이 이어질지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":124.128464,"end":126.2708,"text":"And it seems like it's calling out to me","translation":"날 부르는 것만 같아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":126.368632,"end":128.965,"text":"So come find me","translation":"그러니 와서 날 찾아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":129.13884,"end":132.245,"text":"And let me know","translation":"그리고 내게 알려줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":132.799115,"end":134.015,"text":"What's beyond that line?","translation":"저 선 너머엔 뭐가 있을까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":134.239223,"end":135.515,"text":"Will I cross that line?","translation":"내가 저 선을 넘을까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":135.709334,"end":137.715,"text":"And the line where the sky meets the sea","translation":"하늘과 바다가 맞닿은 저 선은","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":138.129516,"end":140.485,"text":"It calls me","translation":"날 부르고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":140.779715,"end":143.355,"text":"And no one knows","translation":"아무도 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":143.739937,"end":146.595,"text":"How far it goes","translation":"얼마나 멀리 이어질지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":146.850171,"end":152.206013,"text":"If the wind in my sail on the sea stays behind me","translation":"바다 위 내 돛의 바람이 나를 뒤에서 밀어준다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":152.230575,"end":154.645,"text":"One day I'll know","translation":"언젠간 알게 돼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":154.95078,"end":162.475,"text":"How far I'll go","translation":"얼마나 멀리 갈지","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}